                "markdown": "**Fix:** Migrate to ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203), deployed as the hybrid X25519MLKEM768 during the transition. Prioritise this: the exposure starts the day data is recorded. .NET 10 adds MLKem, MLDsa and SlhDsa; Bouncy Castle .NET for earlier runtimes."
              },
