                "markdown": "**Fix:** Migrate to ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203), deployed as the hybrid X25519MLKEM768 during the transition for encryption/key transport; ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204); SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) or LMS/XMSS for long-lived firmware/root keys for signatures. Prioritise this: the exposure starts the day data is recorded. Java 24+ provides ML-KEM (JEP 496) and ML-DSA (JEP 497); Bouncy Castle supports them on older JDKs."
