              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "RSA key generation"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "RSA is broken by Shor's algorithm on a cryptographically relevant quantum computer. NIST IR 8547 (draft) deprecates it after 2030 and disallows it after 2035."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Replace with ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203), deployed as the hybrid X25519MLKEM768 during the transition for encryption/key transport; ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204); SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) or LMS/XMSS for long-lived firmware/root keys for signatures. Go 1.24+ ships crypto/mlkem and enables X25519MLKEM768 in crypto/tls by default.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Replace with ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203), deployed as the hybrid X25519MLKEM768 during the transition for encryption/key transport; ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204); SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) or LMS/XMSS for long-lived firmware/root keys for signatures. Go 1.24+ ships crypto/mlkem and enables X25519MLKEM768 in crypto/tls by default."
              },
